        "original_id": "e0fa47d0-a3e4-5715-b000-23ed476bcc85",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Peverett, Jang Hyun-seung, Erik Cartwright\n- Bands: Foghat, Savoy Brown, Highlight\n- Albums: Zig-Zag Walk, In the Mood for Something Rude\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Peverett was born on 16 April 1943.\n- Dave Peverett was an English singer and musician also known as Lonesome Dave.\n- Dave Peverett served in Savoy Brown before founding Foghat.\n- Dave Peverett was the original lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist of Foghat.\n- Jang Hyun-seung was born on September 3, 1989.\n- Jang Hyun-seung, often credited as Hyunseung, is a South Korean singer.\n- On the album Zig-Zag Walk, Dave Peverett wrote five of the ten songs.\n- On the album Zig-Zag Walk, Erik Cartwright contributed a sixth song.\n- The previous year's album In the Mood for Something Rude consisted entirely of outside material.\n- Jang Hyun-seung, an original member of Highlight, officially left the group in April 2016.\n- Dave Peverett died on 7 February 2000.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
